[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025603\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025692\">7010A04</a></p><p>1. With the window fully raised, undo the bolts fixing the anti-intrusion\npanel.</p><p>2. Remove the anti-intrusion panel.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005183.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the anti-intrusion\npanel is intact and not torn.</p><p>Position the anti-intrusion panel.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025692\">7010A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025603\">5570T96</a></p>"]]